{"id":"03e3216b8128fbcd","group":"16","path":"16/16-prop-closed-comprehension-fibred-ccc.md","title":"闭理解蕴含纤维闭性","display":"prop-closed-comprehension-fibred-ccc — 闭理解蕴含纤维闭性","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-prop-closed-comprehension-fibred-ccc","display":"prop-closed-comprehension-fibred-ccc — 闭理解蕴含纤维闭性","depends_on":["[[16-df-closed-comprehension]]","[[16-df-fibred-cartesian-closed]]","[[16-df-comprehension-quantification]]"],"source":"Proposition 10.5.4, pp. 626–627 (PDF 646–647)","revision_date":"2026-10-16","aliases":["16-prop-closed-comprehension-fibred-ccc","16-prop--closed-comprehension-fibred-ccc"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-prop-closed-comprehension-fibred-ccc"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-closed-comprehension-fibred-ccc — 闭理解蕴含纤维闭性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3015a5a145e2e498\" href=\"?note=3015a5a145e2e498\" title=\"16-df-closed-comprehension\">16-df-closed-comprehension</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fe079ae5e294c97a\" href=\"?note=fe079ae5e294c97a\" title=\"16-df-fibred-cartesian-closed\">16-df-fibred-cartesian-closed</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8f70563c9e9154ec\" href=\"?note=8f70563c9e9154ec\" title=\"16-df-comprehension-quantification\">16-df-comprehension-quantification</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Proposition 10.5.4, pp. 626–627 (PDF 646–647)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-prop-closed-comprehension-fibred-ccc</span><span>16-prop--closed-comprehension-fibred-ccc</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClosedCompr}(p,\\chi)\">\\(\\mathrm{ClosedCompr}(p,\\chi)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\">\\(p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\\in\\mathcal E_I\">\\(X,Y\\in\\mathcal E_I\\)</span>；从该同一闭理解结构的见证中选取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_X,\\Pi_X:\\mathcal E_{\\{X\\}}\\to\\mathcal E_I\">\\(\\Sigma_X,\\Pi_X:\\mathcal E_{\\{X\\}}\\to\\mathcal E_I\\)</span>，其伴随及BC采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8f70563c9e9154ec\" href=\"?note=8f70563c9e9154ec\" title=\"16-df-comprehension-quantification\">16-df-comprehension-quantification</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FibCCC}\">\\(\\mathrm{FibCCC}\\)</span> 的定义及结构参数见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"fe079ae5e294c97a\" href=\"?note=fe079ae5e294c97a\" title=\"16-df-fibred-cartesian-closed\">16-df-fibred-cartesian-closed</a>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"X\\times_IY\\coloneqq\\Sigma_X(\\pi_X^*Y),\\qquad\nY^X\\coloneqq\\Pi_X(\\pi_X^*Y),\\qquad\\mathrm{FibCCC}(p).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[X\\times_IY\\coloneqq\\Sigma_X(\\pi_X^*Y),\\qquad\nY^X\\coloneqq\\Pi_X(\\pi_X^*Y),\\qquad\\mathrm{FibCCC}(p).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>证明（积）：强和给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_{\\Sigma_X\\pi_X^*Y}\\cong\\pi_X\\pi_{\\pi_X^*Y}\">\\(\\pi_{\\Sigma_X\\pi_X^*Y}\\cong\\pi_X\\pi_{\\pi_X^*Y}\\)</span>。理解拉回把后一箭头识别为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_X\\times_I\\pi_Y\">\\(\\pi_X\\times_I\\pi_Y\\)</span>；满忠实性于是给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E_I(Z,X\\times_IY)\\cong\\mathcal E_I(Z,X)\\times\\mathcal E_I(Z,Y)\">\\(\\mathcal E_I(Z,X\\times_IY)\\cong\\mathcal E_I(Z,X)\\times\\mathcal E_I(Z,Y)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>证明（指数）：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E_I(Z,\\Pi_X\\pi_X^*Y)\\cong\\mathcal E_{\\{X\\}}(\\pi_X^*Z,\\pi_X^*Y)\">\\(\\mathcal E_I(Z,\\Pi_X\\pi_X^*Y)\\cong\\mathcal E_{\\{X\\}}(\\pi_X^*Z,\\pi_X^*Y)\\)</span>。用满忠实性及理解拉回，把右侧识别为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E_I(Z\\times_IX,Y)\">\\(\\mathcal E_I(Z\\times_IX,Y)\\)</span>。自然性给出评价与转置的泛性质。</li>\n<li>单位提供纤维终对象；理解拉回以及两个量词的 BC 保证所得积、指数保持换基，故是纤维 CCC。</li>\n<li>来源：Jacobs, <em>Categorical Logic and Type Theory</em>，Proposition 10.5.4, pp. 626–627 (PDF 646–647)。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-closed-comprehension","status":"resolved","id":"3015a5a145e2e498","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-closed-comprehension]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fibred-cartesian-closed","status":"resolved","id":"fe079ae5e294c97a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-fibred-cartesian-closed]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-comprehension-quantification","status":"resolved","id":"8f70563c9e9154ec","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-comprehension-quantification]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-comprehension-quantification","status":"resolved","id":"8f70563c9e9154ec","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X,Y\\in\\mathcal E_I$；从该同一闭理解结构的见证中选取 $\\Sigma_X,\\Pi_X:\\mathcal E_{\\{X\\}}\\to\\mathcal E_I$，其伴随及BC采用 [[16-df-comprehension-quantification]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fibred-cartesian-closed","status":"resolved","id":"fe079ae5e294c97a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FibCCC}$ 的定义及结构参数见 [[16-df-fibred-cartesian-closed]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{ClosedCompr}(p,\\chi)","display":false},{"tex":"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"X,Y\\in\\mathcal E_I","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_X,\\Pi_X:\\mathcal E_{\\{X\\}}\\to\\mathcal E_I","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FibCCC}","display":false},{"tex":"X\\times_IY\\coloneqq\\Sigma_X(\\pi_X^*Y),\\qquad\nY^X\\coloneqq\\Pi_X(\\pi_X^*Y),\\qquad\\mathrm{FibCCC}(p).","display":true},{"tex":"\\pi_{\\Sigma_X\\pi_X^*Y}\\cong\\pi_X\\pi_{\\pi_X^*Y}","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_X\\times_I\\pi_Y","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E_I(Z,X\\times_IY)\\cong\\mathcal E_I(Z,X)\\times\\mathcal E_I(Z,Y)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E_I(Z,\\Pi_X\\pi_X^*Y)\\cong\\mathcal E_{\\{X\\}}(\\pi_X^*Z,\\pi_X^*Y)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E_I(Z\\times_IX,Y)","display":false}],"bytes":1808,"backlinks":[{"id":"3015a5a145e2e498","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"参数 $\\chi$ 不可省略：closed comprehension 是理解范畴的结构性质。纤维 CCC 是推论，见 [[16-prop-closed-comprehension-fibred-ccc]]。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-392","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-prop-closed-comprehension-fibred-ccc|prop-closed-comprehension-fibred-ccc — 闭理解蕴含纤维闭性]]"},{"id":"7d83daba15e3a054","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["3015a5a145e2e498","fe079ae5e294c97a","8f70563c9e9154ec"]}